  "Close to one hundred submissions, made as a team, holding qualifications such as DDDLP, DACE, ACLP, ACTA, IAL-SAE and LL.B.": "Hampir seratus pengajuan, dibuat sebagai sebuah tim, memegang kualifikasi seperti DDDLP, DACE, ACLP, ACTA, IAL-SAE, dan LL.B.",
  "Cohort administration and SOA issuance": "Administrasi kohort dan penerbitan SOA",
  "Commercial sustainability. Without it, the training provider is a one-cycle organisation. With it, the operation scales and attracts repeat enterprise work.": "Keberlanjutan komersial. Tanpanya, penyedia pelatihan hanyalah organisasi satu siklus. Dengannya, operasi berkembang skalanya dan menarik pekerjaan berulang dari perusahaan.",
  "Competency map drawn to the Skills Framework": "Peta kompetensi yang digambar terhadap Skills Framework",
  "Completion rate, assessment pass rate, post-course application such as promotion or deployment, and TRAQOM score. Each is tracked at the course and cohort level, and reported back to the funder and the learner alike.": "Tingkat penyelesaian, tingkat kelulusan asesmen, penerapan pascakursus seperti promosi atau penempatan, dan skor TRAQOM. Masing-masing dilacak pada tingkat kursus dan kohort, serta dilaporkan kembali kepada pemberi dana maupun pembelajar.",
