  "Continuous improvement built into the operating rhythm, not bolted on at audit time. Compounds across cycles.": "Peningkatan berkelanjutan yang tertanam dalam irama operasi, bukan ditempelkan saat audit tiba. Berbunga di sepanjang siklus.",
