  "Describe it in your own words. We reply within two working days, during Singapore business hours.": "Jelaskan dengan kata-kata Anda sendiri. Kami membalas dalam dua hari kerja, pada jam kerja Singapore.",
  "Design": "Desain",
  "Diagnostic against the TPQA criteria": "Diagnostik terhadap kriteria TPQA",
  "Diagrams and labelled pictures.": "Diagram dan gambar berlabel.",
  "Diagrams, arrows and sketches.": "Diagram, panah, dan sketsa.",
  "Diagrams, charts and the shape of an idea on a page tell you more than paragraphs do. You think in pictures, and you remember what you can see.": "Diagram, bagan, dan bentuk sebuah gagasan di atas halaman menyampaikan lebih banyak kepada Anda daripada paragraf. Anda berpikir dalam gambar, dan Anda mengingat apa yang bisa Anda lihat.",
