  "He serves as General Manager of 1ST Aid and Healthcare Pte. Ltd. and leads 2birds, an independent curriculum-development and advisory practice. His career has spanned the Singapore Productivity Centre, the Institute of Singapore Chartered Accountants and Adept Academy. At SGPC he developed courses including the Fair Tenancy Industry Committee programme, which": "Ia menjabat sebagai General Manager 1ST Aid and Healthcare Pte. Ltd. dan memimpin 2birds, sebuah praktik pengembangan kurikulum dan advisori yang independen. Kariernya membentang di Singapore Productivity Centre, Institute of Singapore Chartered Accountants, dan Adept Academy. Di SGPC ia mengembangkan kursus termasuk program Fair Tenancy Industry Committee, yang",
  "He works within SWDA frameworks including WSQ and CASL, and has led training delivery and courseware development for the Singapore Furniture Industries Council Institute, Xprienz, Carrie Academy International, Focus Learning Centre, QD Academy, Addison Institute and HY M&E Consultancy, across artificial intelligence, healthcare, human resources, legal, leadership, food safety, built environment, data science, supply chain and digital analytics.": "Ia bekerja dalam kerangka SWDA termasuk WSQ dan CASL, dan telah memimpin penyampaian pelatihan serta pengembangan perangkat ajar untuk Singapore Furniture Industries Council Institute, Xprienz, Carrie Academy International, Focus Learning Centre, QD Academy, Addison Institute, dan HY M&E Consultancy, di bidang kecerdasan buatan, layanan kesehatan, sumber daya manusia, hukum, kepemimpinan, keamanan pangan, lingkungan terbangun, ilmu data, rantai pasok, dan analitik digital.",
