  "On-the-Job Training": "Pelatihan di Tempat Kerja",
  "Once SWDA approves the course, the slides, the Assessment Plan and the facilitator and learner guides are handed over.": "Setelah SWDA menyetujui kursus, slide, Rencana Asesmen, serta panduan fasilitator dan pembelajar diserahkan.",
