  "Yes, with a public TAEPP record. We provide the CVs of one Level 1 Associate AE and one Level 3 Senior Professional AE for courseware submission.": "Ya, dengan rekam TAEPP publik. Kami menyediakan CV satu AE Associate Level 1 dan satu AE Profesional Senior Level 3 untuk pengajuan perangkat ajar.",
  "Yonex": "Yonex",
  "You can sort and play with it yourself.": "Anda bisa memilah dan mengutak-atiknya sendiri.",
